Third-party data
----------------
RLR reads from third-party corpora and resource catalogues at run time
(Glottolog, the eBible Corpus, unfoldingWord translation notes via the
bible-figures-of-speech package, and others). Those works carry their own
licenses, which are not superseded by RLR's. See docs/04-data-sources.md.

The test fixtures under tests/fixtures include small excerpts of third-party
data, reproduced under their own licenses:

- tests/fixtures/glottolog: rows from the Glottolog CLDF export
  (glottolog/glottolog-cldf), Hammarström, Forkel, Haspelmath & Bank,
  CC BY 4.0, https://glottolog.org/
- tests/fixtures/figures_of_speech: two notes from unfoldingWord Translation
  Notes and translationAcademy, (c) unfoldingWord, CC BY-SA 4.0,
  https://www.unfoldingword.org/ ; reorganised by Sean Boisen (Gloo, LLC).
  Synthetic entries in the same files are RLR's own.
- tests/fixtures/ebible: synthetic, modelled on the eBible Corpus layout.
  No Scripture text is reproduced.
